==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 11 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Blissey ex Drop Event]], which ran from August 6 to 16, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Shining Fates|Horsea|20}} from the {{TCG|Shining Fates}} expansion.
*'''Water Arrow''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Seaking|21}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

